{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/ihk43mizdlulwchhj7hstbdrxbryo3b.mp3","text":"猫猫又增加了，好开心！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7d/c2x8hefs6xxz08k4mbuws1n49o0jt2g.mp3","text":"拉特兰的蛋糕，非常好吃！不过，是不是所有干员都要严格控制体重来着......？呜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/6no78g64i950q27dpf3kwtoehh0qd9z.mp3","text":"手套......这副手套不能摘下来，因为不想让博士看见我的手......只有这个要求，是不行的......对不起......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/cdseggi71n7rb6fsglx6udh6jitwo4g.mp3","text":"要、要出发了吗？好、好的，请让我准备一下...！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/ba/43uj7d731a6dhr8wxt4soeu791hu2ic.mp3","text":"慕斯的尾巴有两条，很奇怪吗？难，难道，我看起来比自己想象的还要奇怪吗？呜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/11awvnyzsm8m7mozl8arm8qbg3x46sz.mp3","text":"其实没有发病的时候，我的手不会变成什么奇怪的样子......能像现在这样用手抱一抱猫猫们，我已经很满足了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/cp444kuv55p43718y632e9tk125ruwh.mp3","text":"博士，芒果味和抹茶味的蛋糕，您喜欢哪一种呢？我试着做了一些......咦，您已经吃过了吗？这样啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/rex06heqhfrqgyaour5y7ulocdbcf1x.mp3","text":"博、博士！那位空小姐，是我最喜欢的偶像空小姐吧？！我没认错！为什么她会在罗德岛......那、那个，能请她帮我签个名吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/85/ps9gdj5uiat1fomec5878yuggucsp86.mp3","text":"博士，您知道爱丽榭大道么？嗯嗯，那里是我出生的地方，真想回去看一看啊......嗯？不，我已经不会感到寂寞了，毕竟，您就是我的家人呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/99c2eqluks83hwj662nv6iyt6kxe0fq.mp3","text":"呜......博士不理我了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/tm1hrgus8vwru1qm84uafu4z4d4j78i.mp3","text":"你好......请、请叫我慕斯......那个，我的手，请您不要盯着我的手看......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/qjrysijod4p601te5mxxh93vstl5vgg.mp3","text":"我绝对不会忘记这份恩情的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/oq4ybmpjserq5aeca2trwj0io53kx6d.mp3","text":"欸？晋、晋升？我还没准备好......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f0/q7f1iqpa4w05xpgquok85u4mt0delvy.mp3","text":"博士，我、我知道自己能力有限，所以，我一定把力所能及的事，全都做好！这也是我唯一能报答博士的方式了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/ti7jwyao8wzyu601g8ti5g5zq9tsale.mp3","text":"嗯，我会努力的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/9d0gkb6asij9t311doib4l94w0giqtk.mp3","text":"我一定能做好的，加油，慕斯！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/dcdv4sqj10nxircjdp0dsvpew0q27xd.mp3","text":"我不太起眼，很适合去侦查敌情......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/e8nqygmm32av1swrj5bhi2w0n5r9wjf.mp3","text":"侦查结束，现在向您报告敌人的位置。","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d5/pfdmzs5qvqk38q43pgdhxaa2rqt7506.mp3","text":"我准备好了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/bxrsncd7sfz1fzl4vwc00oexi7ylosd.mp3","text":"嗯！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/p2t33kufnbrxprnbbavwe7b5yfbz1j4.mp3","text":"慕斯，不会害怕......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/be/p6iw5kqcgsw46df0arb1nce33eddt9n.mp3","text":"从这里开始，是慕斯的战斗了......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/qajlse5foimmftk09sw2thzgyjvq312.mp3","text":"呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/62l7j81t5ux6otu4nvjncdcjtvh9yrc.mp3","text":"离、离我远点！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/c0jxktpshjn34s418512dqu8cg7m0dm.mp3","text":"我也可以战斗的......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e3/effvpfflgaen3ttaf4ozpe44s8pi5xo.mp3","text":"你、你绝对会后悔的......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/idcjmf1rn2fed3uup6pe5zgczvdd7q5.mp3","text":"就算是这样残酷的战斗，慕斯也坚持下来了呢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/gezmv6pjqi8kg0hssksx14wexux45d5.mp3","text":"呼——啊，对不起，虽然我不是很喜欢战斗，但是......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/qcdernn6soja3aj9s6d0esx15m3axzy.mp3","text":"给、给大家拖后腿了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:7/70/tqb6j1wg4hp62oei7lo2anmti6dfnvo.mp3","text":"我还能......再坚持一下......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/niaaz9gpgad6nugs2e0wkdtsqxy86ri.mp3","text":"你、你好，我进来了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/72mwemi2qezws19fc3vik790gtjnicv.mp3","text":"呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:0/04/3drmskfmf0g43kc50l5jb5ysckzzmxk.mp3","text":"博士，我、我实在忍不住了......能给我抓板吗？呜呜呜......","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/jo6joye91hpuj28brzy692f9aov1hct.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/34ilfzdgkvnqx8k6q12ie4mw5oiysea.mp3","text":"博士，新年快乐......！那边放的糕点中有我自己做的，我还准备了一些可以搭配食用的茶水，但是因为我的手套......看起来没有我原先做的那么精致，不过，还是会很好吃的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/ssw70hccrf6wfb5yj7lu6n2jd78bw0k.mp3","text":"你好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_185_frncat/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/rzjy82k8yumq0bqx9nap5zwmjg4s0cy.mp3","text":"猫猫又增加了，好开心！","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5a/tp28xbvb1qfmjz6t00cudbmtgfg4qm1.mp3","text":"拉特兰的蛋糕，非常好吃！不过，是不是所有干员都要严格控制体重来着......？呜......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/o8ltd5o7tvrzq5g97uds2ev0dtefryg.mp3","text":"手套......这副手套不能摘下来，因为不想让博士看见我的手......只有这个要求，是不行的......对不起......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/miwimjso09kn83x4v263lf74jtr8wo1.mp3","text":"要、要出发了吗？好、好的，请让我准备一下...！","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/rfykx1tjk5e53spg1azoqdtov6qqvz9.mp3","text":"慕斯的尾巴有两条，很奇怪吗？难，难道，我看起来比自己想象的还要奇怪吗？呜......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cf/7mnly3l3ix3feb9xlhu9o4ymkpl00tb.mp3","text":"其实没有发病的时候，我的手不会变成什么奇怪的样子......能像现在这样用手抱一抱猫猫们，我已经很满足了......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a9/7utjwjxtz58dkwveglq1q5g9142j5fr.mp3","text":"博士，芒果味和抹茶味的蛋糕，您喜欢哪一种呢？我试着做了一些......咦，您已经吃过了吗？这样啊......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/grb7lw94mrrxmtwkzgn3a91cy2aa32p.mp3","text":"博、博士！那位空小姐，是我最喜欢的偶像空小姐吧？！我没认错！为什么她会在罗德岛......那、那个，能请她帮我签个名吗？","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/1w8n3cduy3nd41wwd1wj4hbcx5p1qtj.mp3","text":"博士，您知道爱丽榭大道么？嗯嗯，那里是我出生的地方，真想回去看一看啊......嗯？不，我已经不会感到寂寞了，毕竟，您就是我的家人呀！","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:8/81/o653g7qcyz3izk43tx46rmkwfobqt3i.mp3","text":"呜......博士不理我了......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/081bb6q8xi6pdd79vfftl857hudflzl.mp3","text":"你好......请、请叫我慕斯......那个，我的手，请您不要盯着我的手看......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/59/3722mcrms8i5o5ucfnqcwlolo0ses8d.mp3","text":"我绝对不会忘记这份恩情的！","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/fwsdw0yog04j2ak4tu7avbjh3teg6gx.mp3","text":"欸？晋、晋升？我还没准备好......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/02/7crcsfqufds9t7k97q4y7somx84r56f.mp3","text":"博士，我、我知道自己能力有限，所以，我一定把力所能及的事，全都做好！这也是我唯一能报答博士的方式了......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/mrm39w46xhbsbfdo6yl7pk8kxk7nyom.mp3","text":"嗯，我会努力的。","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/tnu3rl0uf4oy234erydzog6sayj6fyf.mp3","text":"我一定能做好的，加油，慕斯！","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/hg1y0yh32mb64th9ia7mt6pjta7o87w.mp3","text":"我不太起眼，很适合去侦查敌情......","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/dk01svd0fqaq77ss0ouc1cpf1x72v0a.mp3","text":"侦查结束，现在向您报告敌人的位置。","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:0/05/c2mukkwce1o2o629liusiwacrj5eo18.mp3","text":"我准备好了！","alt":"voice/char_185_frncat/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/ls18hmd1fc8bumka1